# Google Maps Platform API Key (Required for client-side Maps JS API and server-side BFF proxies)
#
# Quickstart — Obtain a free zero-billing Maps Demo Key for prototyping:
# 1. Open https://mapsplatform.google.com/maps-demo-key?utm_campaign=gmp_git_agentsamples_v1.0.0
# 2. Sign in with any Google account (no billing card required for the Demo Key).
# 3. Accept the Maps Demo Project Terms when prompted.
# 4. Generate/reveal the demo key and paste it into `.env.local` (never commit `.env.local`).
#
# For production, create and restrict a Google Cloud API key with:
# - Maps JavaScript API
# - Places API (New)
# - Routes API
# - Geocoding API
#
# Copy this file to `.env.local` and replace the placeholder below:
NEXT_PUBLIC_GOOGLE_MAPS_API_KEY=your_google_maps_api_key_here

# Optional server-only key override for /api/* Route Handlers (defaults to NEXT_PUBLIC_GOOGLE_MAPS_API_KEY if omitted):
# GOOGLE_MAPS_API_KEY=your_server_restricted_api_key_here
